    "updated_at": "2016-08-28T07:12:35Z",
    "body": "What is the problem with using `a` elements? I don't really follow the proposal or the problem.\n\nI suggest reading through: https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/FAQ#Is_there_a_process_for_adding_new_features_to_a_specification.3F.\n",
